     "ex": "certain:     The fix will be live today.\nvery likely: The fix will probably be live today.\nlikely:      The fix is likely to be live today.\npossible:    The fix may be live today, but it depends on Meta’s review.\nunlikely:    It’s unlikely to be live before Monday."
