     "p": {
      "ar": "**warmth** من غير ما تبقى غير محترف: اسم الشخص، جملة شخصية قصيرة («Hope the launch went well»)، شكر محدد، و**exclamation mark** واحدة بالكتير في الإيميل. **emoji** مقبولة في سلاك/واتساب مع ناس بتستخدمها، مش في أول إيميل لعميل.",
      "en": "**warmth** without being unprofessional: the person’s name, a short personal line («Hope the launch went well»), specific thanks, and at most one **exclamation mark** per email. An **emoji** is fine on Slack/WhatsApp with people who use them, not in a first email to a client."
     },
     "ex": "cold:  \"Please find attached the report.\"\nwarm:  \"Hi Sara, hope the launch went well! I’ve attached the September report — the highlight is that manual work dropped by 70%. Thanks again for your quick feedback on the dashboard.\"\ntoo much: \"Hiii!!! 😍😍 Here’s the report!!!\""
